import { LogoSection } from '../app/components/ds/LogoSection';
---
<Docs title="Logo System" description="Original raster masters and existing SVG illustrations. The SVG illustrations are not certified vector reproductions of the raster masters." active="logos"><div class="legacy-example"><LogoSection client:visible/></div><section class="docs-card"><h2>Existing transparent raster derivative</h2><p>The platform asset archive contains a true-alpha cutout whose original file hash matches this repository’s primary PNG. It is a raster derivative, not a vector master. No new tracing or geometry was generated.</p><div style="background:#0D1829;padding:24px;--preview-bg:#0D1829" data-brand-preview="true"><img src="/assets/botsfired-primary-transparent.png" alt="Existing BotsFired primary raster cutout" width="320" height="47"/></div><a href="/assets/botsfired-primary-transparent.png" download>Download existing transparent PNG</a></section><section class="docs-card"><h2>Source status</h2><p>The two PNG masters are opaque. Their white plates preserve the source pixels; whitening an opaque asset erases the mark. Gallery SVG illustrations contain vector paths and live text, but are not exact vector masters of the PNG artwork. Call and merchandise SVGs embed a raster logo and must not be described as fully vector.</p><p>A transparent or redrawn master needs an authenticated original or brand-owner review. No redraw, auto-trace or certified Pantone conversion has been performed.</p></section></Docs>
